{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21761","headline":"乐府古题序 田野狐兔行 · 元稹","name":"乐府古题序 田野狐兔行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种豆耘锄，种禾沟甽。\n禾苗豆甲，狐榾兔翦。\n割鹄餧鹰，烹麟噉犬。\n鹰怕兔毫，犬被狐引。\n狐兔相须，鹰犬相尽。\n日暗天寒，禾稀豆损。\n鹰犬就烹，狐兔俱哂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}